{"data": {"event": {"id": "6824c4e7-ed9d-47a7-8f86-c745626dd652", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/1282/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ances de cours", "sessionTypeColor": "#6545fa", "voting": null, "title": "Pathologies mammaires chez l\u2019adolescente et la femme jeune : ce que le radiologue doit savoir", "start": "2026-10-11T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-11T12:15+02:00", "objectives": ["<p>D\u00e9crire le spectre des pathologies mammaires chez l\u2019adolescente et la femme jeune, leur \u00e9pid\u00e9miologie, et leurs pr\u00e9sentations cliniques et radiologiques.</p>", "<p>Adapter la strat\u00e9gie d\u2019imagerie au contexte clinique et \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2ge (\u00e9chographie, IRM mammaire, place limit\u00e9e de la mammographie, indications de l\u2019IRM corps entier), et reconna\u00eetre les signes d\u2019alerte de malignit\u00e9.</p>", "<p>Orienter la prise en charge (surveillance, biopsie, adressage sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9, RCP) afin de limiter les retards diagnostiques et optimiser le parcours de soins des patientes jeunes.</p>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "b2cdf3e0-ef93-4444-844a-94ea26aab669", "name": "252", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "1cbbc9ad-3869-48ea-a40c-060a35cc9fc0", "title": "Imagerie des masses mammaires de l\u2019adolescente", "start": "2026-10-11T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-11T11:30+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "1CBBC9AD-3869-48EA-A40C-060A35CC9FC0"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "4c75d9fa-7fca-4a9f-ac7e-389e89d14891", "lastName": "Cardoen", "firstName": "Liesbeth", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=235102&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Paris"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": {"id": "5dd10756-b530-4330-bb11-a24bba024fa